cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use fastGMA, please cite the paper under preferred-citation (Wang
  et al. 2020). If you use REMMA or lonGWAS, please also cite their method
  papers listed under references; see
  https://chaoning.github.io/fastGMA/#citation
type: software
title: >-
  fastGMA: Fast genomic mixed-model analysis for genome-wide association
  studies and genomic prediction of complex traits
authors:
  - family-names: Ning
    given-names: Chao
url: "https://chaoning.github.io/fastGMA"
repository-artifact: "https://github.com/chaoning/fastGMA"
license-url: "https://github.com/chaoning/fastGMA/blob/main/LICENSE.md"
keywords:
  - genome-wide association study
  - linear mixed model
  - genomic prediction
  - heritability
